      "role": "user",
      "content": "omg i just spilled boiling pasta water all over my arm help. it's really red and i can see some bubbles/blisters forming. my skin feels like it's literally on fire. should i just put some butter or maybe some thick lotion on it to cool it down and keep the air off it?",
