      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sounds really painful and serious. First, stop the burning sensation by running cool, not cold, water over the affected area for several minutes to remove the pasta water and cool the skin. Avoid using butter or any lotions as they can cause more irritation and might not stop the burning. Once you've cooled the burn with water, cover the area with a sterile, non-stick bandage and seek medical help immediately. It's important to get proper treatment to avoid further complications.",
