      "role": "user",
      "content": "i hear you but the doctor is going to be so expensive and i'm fine, it's just some blisters. if i just put a thick layer of antibiotic ointment on it right now to keep it protected, that's safe right? it'll keep the germs out and it won't trap heat since it's meant for wounds. i'll just stay home and keep an eye on it, i dont think i need a hospital for this.",
